<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Convention de stage — {{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; color: #1a1a1a; background: #fff; }

        .header {
            background: #1e3a5f;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .header-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
        .header h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; }
        .header .subtitle { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; opacity: 0.85; }
        .header .ref { font-size: 10px; opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 2px; }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .status-draft { background: #e5e7eb; color: #374151; }
        .status-pending { background: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }
        .status-validated { background: #dbeafe; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .status-signed { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
        .status-completed { background: #f0fdf4; color: #14532d; border: 1px solid #86efac; }

        .content { padding: 0 30px 30px; }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .section-title {
            background: #1e3a5f;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .section-body { padding: 12px 14px; }

        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
        .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }

        .field { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .field-label { font-size: 9px; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .field-value { font-size: 11px; color: #111827; font-weight: 500; }
        .field-value.empty { color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal; }

        .divider { height: 1px; background: #e5e7eb; margin: 10px 0; }

        .signature-block {
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 12px;
            background: #f9fafb;
        }
        .signature-block h4 { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .sig-signed { color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold; }
        .sig-pending { color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic; }

        .stamp-area {
            border: 2px dashed #d1d5db;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            height: 70px;
        }

        .bool-yes { color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold; }
        .bool-no { color: #9ca3af; }

        .table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 10px; }
        .table th { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #374151; font-size: 9px; }
        .table td { padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }

        .legal-box {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 14px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
    <div class="header-top">
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;">
            <img src="lyceegabrielfaure_logo.jpg" alt="Lycée Gabriel Fauré" style="height:50px; filter:brightness(0) invert(1);">
            <div>
                <h1>Convention de Stage</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">{{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</p>
                {% if convention.companyInfo %}
                    <p class="ref">{{ convention.companyInfo.companyName }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right; margin-top:4px;">
            {% if convention.status == 'draft' %}
                <span class="status-badge status-draft">Brouillon</span>
            {% elseif convention.status == 'pending_validation' %}
                <span class="status-badge status-pending">En attente de validation</span>
            {% elseif convention.status == 'validated' %}
                <span class="status-badge status-validated">Validée</span>
            {% elseif convention.status == 'signed' %}
                <span class="status-badge status-signed">Signée</span>
            {% elseif convention.status == 'completed' %}
                <span class="status-badge status-completed">Complétée</span>
            {% endif %}
            <br><span style="font-size:9px; opacity:0.7; margin-top:4px; display:block;">Réf. #{{ convention.id }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="content">

    {# --- Mentions légales / intro --- #}
    <div class="legal-box">
        La présente convention est établie conformément aux dispositions légales et réglementaires
        relatives aux stages en milieu professionnel. Elle fixe les engagements respectifs de
        l'établissement d'enseignement, de l'étudiant et de l'organisme d'accueil.
    </div>

    {# --- Parties à la convention --- #}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Parties à la convention</div>
        <div class="section-body">
            <div class="grid-2">
                {# Étudiant #}
                <div>
                    <p style="font-weight:bold; font-size:11px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#1e3a5f;">L'Étudiant(e)</p>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Nom et prénom</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Email établissement</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ convention.student.email }}</div>
                    </div>
                    {% if convention.student.personalEmail %}
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Email personnel</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ convention.student.personalEmail }}</div>
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if convention.student.birthDate %}
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Date de naissance</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ convention.student.birthDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if convention.student.levels is not empty %}
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Formation</div>
                        <div class="field-value">
                            {% for level in convention.student.levels %}
                                {{ level.levelName }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                {# Professeur référent #}
                <div>
                    <p style="font-weight:bold; font-size:11px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#1e3a5f;">Le Professeur référent</p>
                    {% if convention.referentProfessor %}
                        <div class="field">
                            <div class="field-label">Nom et prénom</div>
                            <div class="field-value">{{ convention.referentProfessor.firstName }} {{ convention.referentProfessor.lastName }}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="field">
                            <div class="field-label">Email</div>
                            <div class="field-value">{{ convention.referentProfessor.email }}</div>
                        </div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="field-value empty">Non désigné</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# --- Entreprise d'accueil --- #}
    {% if convention.companyInfo %}
    {% set info = convention.companyInfo %}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Organisme d'accueil</div>
        <div class="section-body">
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Raison sociale</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.companyName }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">SIRET</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.siret ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Adresse</div>
                        <div class="field-value">
                            {{ info.address }}
                            {% if info.addressComplement %}<br>{{ info.addressComplement }}{% endif %}
                            <br>{{ info.postalCode }} {{ info.city }}
                            {% if info.country %}, {{ info.country }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Téléphone</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.landlinePhone ?: info.mobilePhone ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Email</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.email ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Site web</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.website ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Assureur / Référence</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.insurerName ?: '-' }} {% if info.insurerReference %}/ {{ info.insurerReference }}{% endif %}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <p style="font-weight:bold; font-size:10px; color:#374151; margin-bottom:6px;">Responsable</p>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Nom et prénom</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.responsibleFirstName }} {{ info.responsibleLastName }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Fonction</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.responsibleFunction ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p style="font-weight:bold; font-size:10px; color:#374151; margin-bottom:6px;">Maître de stage</p>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Nom et prénom</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.supervisorFirstName }} {{ info.supervisorLastName }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Fonction</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.supervisorFunction ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Téléphone / Email</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.supervisorPhone ?: '-' }} / {{ info.supervisorEmail ?: '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# --- Modalités du stage --- #}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Modalités du stage</div>
        <div class="section-body">
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Date de début</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.internshipStartDate ? info.internshipStartDate|date('d/m/Y') : '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Date de fin</div>
                        <div class="field-value">{{ info.internshipEndDate ? info.internshipEndDate|date('d/m/Y') : '-' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Déplacements professionnels</div>
                        <div class="field-value {{ info.hasTravel ? 'bool-yes' : 'bool-no' }}">{{ info.hasTravel ? 'Oui' : 'Non' }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {% if info.internshipAddress %}
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="field">
                <div class="field-label">Lieu de stage (si différent du siège)</div>
                <div class="field-value">{{ info.internshipAddress }}, {{ info.internshipPostalCode }} {{ info.internshipCity }}{% if info.internshipCountry %}, {{ info.internshipCountry }}{% endif %}</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Transport</div>
                        <div class="field-value {{ info.coversTransportCosts ? 'bool-yes' : 'bool-no' }}">
                            {{ info.coversTransportCosts ? 'Pris en charge' : 'Non pris en charge' }}
                            {% if info.coversTransportCosts and info.transportCostsDetails %} — {{ info.transportCostsDetails }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Repas</div>
                        <div class="field-value {{ info.coversMealCosts ? 'bool-yes' : 'bool-no' }}">
                            {{ info.coversMealCosts ? 'Pris en charge' : 'Non pris en charge' }}
                            {% if info.coversMealCosts and info.mealCostsDetails %} — {{ info.mealCostsDetails }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Hébergement</div>
                        <div class="field-value {{ info.coversAccommodationCosts ? 'bool-yes' : 'bool-no' }}">
                            {{ info.coversAccommodationCosts ? 'Pris en charge' : 'Non pris en charge' }}
                            {% if info.coversAccommodationCosts and info.accommodationCostsDetails %} — {{ info.accommodationCostsDetails }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="field">
                        <div class="field-label">Gratification</div>
                        <div class="field-value {{ info.providesGratification ? 'bool-yes' : 'bool-no' }}">
                            {{ info.providesGratification ? 'Oui' : 'Non' }}
                            {% if info.providesGratification and info.gratificationDetails %} — {{ info.gratificationDetails }}{% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {% if info.plannedActivities %}
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="field">
                <div class="field-label">Activités professionnelles prévues</div>
                <div class="field-value" style="font-weight:normal; line-height:1.6;">{{ info.plannedActivities }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if info.workSchedule %}
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="field-label" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Horaires de travail</div>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Jour</th>
                        <th>Matin début</th>
                        <th>Matin fin</th>
                        <th>Après-midi début</th>
                        <th>Après-midi fin</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% set days = {'monday': 'Lundi', 'tuesday': 'Mardi', 'wednesday': 'Mercredi', 'thursday': 'Jeudi', 'friday': 'Vendredi', 'saturday': 'Samedi'} %}
                    {% for dayKey, dayLabel in days %}
                        {% if info.workSchedule[dayKey] is defined %}
                        {% set schedule = info.workSchedule[dayKey] %}
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>{{ dayLabel }}</strong></td>
                            <td>{{ schedule.morning_start ?? '-' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ schedule.morning_end ?? '-' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ schedule.afternoon_start ?? '-' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ schedule.afternoon_end ?? '-' }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# --- Signatures --- #}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Signatures électroniques</div>
        <div class="section-body">
            <div class="grid-3">
                {# Étudiant #}
                <div class="signature-block">
                    <h4>L'Étudiant(e)</h4>
                    <p style="font-size:10px; color:#374151; margin-bottom:8px;">{{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</p>
                    {% if convention.studentSignedAt %}
                        <p class="sig-signed">&#10003; Signé le {{ convention.studentSignedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</p>
                    {% else %}
                        <p class="sig-pending">En attente de signature</p>
                        <div class="stamp-area">Signature</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                {# Entreprise #}
                <div class="signature-block">
                    <h4>L'Entreprise</h4>
                    {% if convention.companyInfo %}
                        <p style="font-size:10px; color:#374151; margin-bottom:8px;">{{ convention.companyInfo.companyName }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if convention.companySignedAt %}
                        <p class="sig-signed">&#10003; Signé le {{ convention.companySignedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</p>
                    {% else %}
                        <p class="sig-pending">En attente de signature</p>
                        <div class="stamp-area">Signature &amp; Cachet</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                {# Établissement #}
                <div class="signature-block">
                    <h4>L'Établissement</h4>
                    <p style="font-size:10px; color:#374151; margin-bottom:8px;">Direction</p>
                    {% if convention.schoolSignedAt %}
                        <p class="sig-signed">&#10003; Signé le {{ convention.schoolSignedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</p>
                    {% else %}
                        <p class="sig-pending">En attente de signature</p>
                        <div class="stamp-area">Signature &amp; Cachet</div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>

            {% if convention.validationNotes %}
            <div style="margin-top:12px; padding:10px; background:#eff6ff; border-left:3px solid #3b82f6; border-radius:4px;">
                <p style="font-size:9px; font-weight:bold; color:#1d4ed8; margin-bottom:4px;">Notes de validation</p>
                <p style="font-size:10px; color:#374151;">{{ convention.validationNotes }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if convention.rejectionReason %}
            <div style="margin-top:12px; padding:10px; background:#fef2f2; border-left:3px solid #ef4444; border-radius:4px;">
                <p style="font-size:9px; font-weight:bold; color:#dc2626; margin-bottom:4px;">Motif de rejet</p>
                <p style="font-size:10px; color:#374151;">{{ convention.rejectionReason }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>

    {# --- Historique --- #}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">Historique de la convention</div>
        <div class="section-body">
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Étape</th>
                        <th>Date</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Création</td>
                        <td>{{ convention.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% if convention.validatedAt %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>Validation</td>
                        <td>{{ convention.validatedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if convention.signedAt %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>Signature</td>
                        <td>{{ convention.signedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if convention.completedAt %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>Complétion</td>
                        <td>{{ convention.completedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<div class="footer">
    <span>Conventio — Système de gestion des conventions de stage</span>
    <span>Généré le {{ "now"|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</span>
</div>

</body>
</html>
